                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Dix-huit mois de detours"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Le premier vehicule a franchi l ouvrage a 6 h 12, sous les applaudissements d une trentaine d habitants venus malgre le froid."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "level": 3,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Ce que le chantier a change"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Les acces ont ete elargis, et le trottoir cote amont permet desormais de traverser a pied."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "level": 2,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Ce qui reste a faire"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "La passerelle cyclable, ecartee du marche initial, attend un financement du departement."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
